{"id":"404586617","kind":"article","title":"专家回答启发式（来自 Issa Rice）","author":"Andy Matuschak","original_authors":["Andy Matuschak"],"original_source_urls":["https://notes.andymatuschak.org/zEfpMY7F12gQ6NcbycHCNdpXqxb2mxdkJiX","https://notes.andymatuschak.org/z2pzGHXwct867CYxcBwUABg"],"publisher":"Thoughts Memo","column":"间隔重复 & 注意力管理","date":"2021-08-28","updated":"2024-01-17","votes":12,"comment_count":4,"minutes":1,"chars":708,"keywords":["间隔重复","助记媒介","卡片设计","精细编码","概念理解"],"summary":"Issa Rice 的启发式是：高质量记忆卡应能由领域专家脱离具体来源直接回答。若卡片依赖某篇助记材料的措辞或例子，虽可帮助精细编码和兴趣，却可能造成狭窄理解；共享卡片尤其容易因考查来源特定表达而产生令人沮丧的错误否定。","zhihu_url":"https://zhuanlan.zhihu.com/p/404586617","restoration":null,"toc":[{"id":"sec-1","level":2,"title":"链接至本文（已汉化）"},{"id":"sec-2","level":2,"title":"声明"}],"html":"<p data-pid=\"3hqKEdiz\"><a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://notes.andymatuschak.org/zPnAxzBTDgjCabaBJkUrjL4roGR1xD1XJvo\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Issa Rice</a> <a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://wiki.issarice.com/wiki/Expert_response_heuristic_for_prompt_writing\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">建议</a>，对于<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://notes.andymatuschak.org/z4eXdSMJFv2qVGXSUEKH4vdcHBrLHcFY1ZGfC\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">间隔重复记忆系统</a><sup class=\"cite\" id=\"cite-1\"><a href=\"#ref-1\">[1]</a></sup>（尤其是<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://notes.andymatuschak.org/z4rRX3qwSSJRsEkdXKwH2shamgHNeRthrMLiF\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">助记媒介</a><sup class=\"cite\" id=\"cite-2\"><a href=\"#ref-2\">[2]</a></sup>）来说，一个有用的启发式是，已经是该领域专家的人应该能够回答那些不需要参考特定的助记文章或来源的记忆卡片。</p><p data-pid=\"IGfEyDOU\">当一个助记卡片不能满足这个启发式的要求时，它通常是在编码作者特定的解释、框架、例子、措辞等。这通常是有帮助的，特别是作为一种<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://notes.andymatuschak.org/z3ZTBNhJddpewTBgbKAFy2cnSMBiJRpMZWsfB\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">精细编码</a><sup class=\"cite\" id=\"cite-3\"><a href=\"#ref-3\">[3]</a></sup>，或一条培养情感兴趣的道路。但它也可能导致狭隘的理解。在共享的记忆卡片或助记媒介的情况中，这种记忆卡片会产生令人沮丧的错误否定，因为它们要求读者学习一个具体的材料来源是如何呈现出材料的：<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://notes.andymatuschak.org/zMFKJdtNGpucVUcitRVJiMxfyoNY4A4c2Bd\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">助记媒介的读者有时会因作者的用词而感到受阻</a><sup class=\"cite\" id=\"cite-4\"><a href=\"#ref-4\">[4]</a></sup>。</p><p data-pid=\"gBScmKP2\">这与<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://notes.andymatuschak.org/z6bci25mVUBNFdVWSrQNKr6u7AZ1jFzfTVbMF\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">常青笔记应面向概念</a><sup class=\"cite\" id=\"cite-5\"><a href=\"#ref-5\">[5]</a></sup>有一个有趣的联系。</p><hr/><p data-pid=\"PD-Ma6SZ\">问：根据专家回答启发式，如何编写间隔重复系统的记忆卡片？ <br/>答：这个问题的专家可以不参考特定的源材料来回答这些问题。</p><p data-pid=\"UVbWnnVx\">问：当间隔重复系统的卡片不遵循专家回答启发式时，学习到的知识可能会受到什么限制？ <br/>答：它可能是知识的狭隘编码。</p><p data-pid=\"jycYiYK8\">问：为什么共享的间隔重复系统记忆卡片在不遵循专家回答启发式时经常令人沮丧？ <br/>答：他们可能会优先考虑某个特定来源的观点，而不是关注普遍的观点。</p><h2 id=\"sec-1\">链接至本文（已汉化）</h2><ul><li data-pid=\"G1nQzNAM\"><a class=\"internal tm-internal\" data-tm-id=\"398094270\" href=\"#/post/398094270\">高质量的间隔重复记忆卡片最重要的属性是什么？</a></li><li data-pid=\"zqLob26F\"><a class=\"internal tm-internal\" data-tm-id=\"404396584\" href=\"#/post/404396584\">在非技术性的助记文本中，填空卡经常引起挫败感</a></li><li data-pid=\"Go_BubWP\"><a class=\"internal tm-internal\" data-tm-id=\"650014568\" href=\"#/post/650014568\">助记媒介的读者有时会因作者的用词而感到受阻</a></li><li data-pid=\"AEHukqY-\"><a class=\"internal tm-internal\" data-tm-id=\"678195187\" href=\"#/post/678195187\">阅读理解问题令人不快</a></li></ul><h2 id=\"sec-2\">声明</h2><p data-pid=\"llR8Amg1\">此内容发布由 Andy Matuschak 许可。未经允许，不得转载或修改。保留所有权利。</p><p class=\"ztext-empty-paragraph\"><br/></p><blockquote data-pid=\"-OxVtndk\">译者： <a class=\"member_mention\" data-hash=\"8bb79b58ce5aed33e8a041a90bbc0667\" data-hovercard=\"p$b$8bb79b58ce5aed33e8a041a90bbc0667\" href=\"https://www.zhihu.com/people/8bb79b58ce5aed33e8a041a90bbc0667\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">@ACRL</a> <br/>校对： <a class=\"member_mention\" data-hash=\"4c592f496dc33822b560b382907ff1d0\" data-hovercard=\"p$b$4c592f496dc33822b560b382907ff1d0\" href=\"https://www.zhihu.com/people/L.M.Sherlock\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">@叶峻峣</a> <br/>原文：<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://notes.andymatuschak.org/zEfpMY7F12gQ6NcbycHCNdpXqxb2mxdkJiX\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Expert response heuristic, after Issa Rice</a></blockquote><hr/><ol class=\"references\"><li id=\"ref-1\"><a aria-label=\"返回正文\" class=\"ref-back\" href=\"#cite-1\">↩</a> 间隔重复记忆系统（Spaced repetition memory system） <a class=\"tm-internal\" data-tm-id=\"404257681\" href=\"#/post/404257681\">站内阅读 ↗</a></li><li id=\"ref-2\"><a aria-label=\"返回正文\" class=\"ref-back\" href=\"#cite-2\">↩</a> 助记媒介（Mnemonic medium） <a class=\"tm-internal\" data-tm-id=\"459483765\" href=\"#/post/459483765\">站内阅读 ↗</a></li><li id=\"ref-3\"><a aria-label=\"返回正文\" class=\"ref-back\" href=\"#cite-3\">↩</a> 精细编码 <a class=\"tm-internal\" data-tm-id=\"458013236\" href=\"#/post/458013236\">站内阅读 ↗</a></li><li id=\"ref-4\"><a aria-label=\"返回正文\" class=\"ref-back\" href=\"#cite-4\">↩</a> 助记媒介的读者有时会因作者的用词而感到受阻 <a class=\"tm-internal\" data-tm-id=\"650014568\" href=\"#/post/650014568\">站内阅读 ↗</a></li><li id=\"ref-5\"><a aria-label=\"返回正文\" class=\"ref-back\" href=\"#cite-5\">↩</a> 常青笔记应面向概念 <a class=\"tm-internal\" data-tm-id=\"421580357\" href=\"#/post/421580357\">站内阅读 ↗</a></li></ol>","rec_chain":[{"id":"404396584","title":"在非技术性的助记文本中，填空卡经常引起挫败感","author":"Andy Matuschak","votes":15,"minutes":2,"reason":"同专栏上一篇 · 间隔重复 & 注意力管理"},{"id":"404698925","title":"避免使用「对或错」间隔重复记忆卡片","author":"Andy Matuschak","votes":14,"minutes":1,"reason":"同专栏下一篇 · 间隔重复 & 注意力管理"},{"id":"650014568","title":"助记媒介的读者有时会因作者的用词而感到受阻","author":"Andy Matuschak","votes":5,"minutes":4,"reason":"本文直接引用"},{"id":"459483765","title":"助记媒介（Mnemonic medium）","author":"Andy Matuschak","votes":37,"minutes":6,"reason":"本文直接引用"},{"id":"421580357","title":"常青笔记应面向概念","author":"Andy Matuschak","votes":38,"minutes":5,"reason":"本文直接引用"}],"rec_bridge":[{"id":"578902325","title":"卡片写作的模拟教学法","author":"Issa Rice","votes":16,"minutes":1,"reason":"跨作者共鸣「卡片设计」· Issa Rice"}],"rec_answers":[{"id":"2772990761","title":"如何构建自己的笔记系统？","author":"Thoughts Memo","votes":755,"minutes":20,"reason":"核心节选引用 · 755 赞同","evidence":"回答以锚文本「在 Issa Rice 之后，专家回答启发式」直接指向目标译文；该锚文本是可辨认的标题或主题词。"}]}